WEBVTT

00:02:20.220 --> 00:02:30.000
It's as thick as pea soup. I can't see which way to go.

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:36.080
to protect his evil dynasty stronghold but if this keeps up we will never be able to find our way

00:02:36.080 --> 00:02:42.050
i guess talpa's freaked out because we're so close and he knows this fog will slow us down

00:02:42.050 --> 00:02:47.270
that jerk will use anything he can to try and stop us from tracking him down won't he

00:02:47.270 --> 00:02:53.580
well this isn't normal fog huh mia just what are you talking about

00:02:53.580 --> 00:03:00.000
just something my grandfather said he once told me of a corridor of fog that

00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:05.750
It hides a moat that doesn't have any water and a stone fence with no stone.

00:03:05.750 --> 00:03:12.850
It protects the castle of Talpa and the only way in is through the main gate.

00:03:12.850 --> 00:03:13.800
What a place!

00:03:13.800 --> 00:03:16.240
A moat with no water?

00:03:16.240 --> 00:03:20.840
You mean to tell me we could be standing in the moat with no water right now?

00:03:20.840 --> 00:03:21.840
Weird.

00:03:21.840 --> 00:03:25.190
It sorta does feel like we're standing in water.

00:03:25.190 --> 00:03:28.640
Man, I am sick of talking about how great Talpa is.

00:03:28.640 --> 00:03:30.000
He won't even come out and fight.

00:03:30.160 --> 00:03:31.620
Hey, chill out, Kento.

00:03:31.940 --> 00:03:35.220
The best thing we can do right now is just to keep moving.

00:04:07.320 --> 00:04:09.320
a fence with no stones.

00:04:09.320 --> 00:04:12.600
Is this a joke?

00:04:12.600 --> 00:04:15.600
This thing couldn't keep out a mouse, let alone the mighty ronin warriors.

00:04:15.600 --> 00:04:17.600
Watch, I'll pass right through it.

00:04:17.600 --> 00:04:18.600
Kanto, stop!

00:04:18.600 --> 00:04:21.920
We have to be cool, it might be a trap.

00:04:21.920 --> 00:04:25.330
You're right, we don't know what it might do.

00:04:25.330 --> 00:04:27.330
Hey, you got cold feet?

00:04:27.330 --> 00:04:30.000
Hey Kanto, help me push this through first.

00:04:30.030 --> 00:04:43.190
oh and that's no way to treat my wheels good luck later dudes I'll see you on

00:04:43.190 --> 00:04:51.790
the other side okay what a hot dog I can't believe Kento would just take off

00:04:51.790 --> 00:04:59.350
like that nothing's gonna happen out here those guys worry too much

00:05:01.880 --> 00:05:07.100
- Hey, what if nothing happens?

00:05:07.100 --> 00:05:11.170
- Bummer, there isn't any action.

00:06:09.660 --> 00:06:15.580
Pathetic creatures coming for me. They'll stop warlord of illusion come here

00:06:16.120 --> 00:06:19.750
You summoned me master. How may I serve?

00:06:20.070 --> 00:06:27.520
Are you aware that the rune and warriors are trying to enter the castle? Yes master very good

00:06:27.520 --> 00:06:30.000
I shall now give you a chance

00:06:32.300 --> 00:06:36.330
I will not fail you, master.

00:06:36.330 --> 00:06:39.850
I have a plan that will stop the rodent warriors.

00:06:39.850 --> 00:06:42.310
I know how to destroy them.

00:06:42.310 --> 00:06:43.510
Ah.

00:06:43.510 --> 00:06:46.490
I must be allowed to open the castle gate.

00:06:46.490 --> 00:06:47.890
Have you lost your mind?

00:06:47.890 --> 00:06:52.240
You are asking me to open the gates and let them enter?

00:06:52.240 --> 00:06:53.170
Yes.

00:06:53.170 --> 00:06:55.850
Then they'll walk straight into my trap.

00:06:55.850 --> 00:06:59.920
Inside it will be easy to control the power of their armor.

00:07:00.440 --> 00:07:06.370
I will be waiting for you, and I will crush them with the help of the Dark Spirits.

00:07:06.370 --> 00:07:16.790
Hmm. Your plan has merit. Use your power and the evil of the spirits of the Dark Realm to destroy them once they are inside the gates.

00:07:16.790 --> 00:07:21.920
But you must not fail me or your punishment will be severe.

00:07:21.920 --> 00:07:26.190
Trust me, and I will not disappoint you, Master.

00:07:26.190 --> 00:07:26.920
Hmm.

00:07:30.760 --> 00:07:33.160
We need to find a way out of this weird fog.

00:07:33.160 --> 00:07:36.160
Well, we couldn't pass through even with our armor.

00:07:36.160 --> 00:07:38.740
I don't think Mia and Yuli should even try.

00:07:38.740 --> 00:07:44.600
Hey dudes, maybe we should find the gate Mia told us about?

00:07:44.600 --> 00:07:47.230
Well, that's the only way into the castle, right?

00:07:47.230 --> 00:07:58.520
I mean, but, well, it's lifting.

00:07:58.520 --> 00:07:59.060
Why is it...

00:08:00.570 --> 00:08:02.450
Oh, man, I bet something's up.

00:08:02.790 --> 00:08:04.000
I'm going to check it out.

00:08:19.170 --> 00:08:30.000
Those gates are high.

00:08:30.160 --> 00:08:31.040
than this building.

00:08:34.230 --> 00:08:36.380
Let's kick it.

00:08:37.400 --> 00:08:38.140
Wait a second.

00:08:38.940 --> 00:08:40.440
Mia and Yuli can't go.

00:08:40.800 --> 00:08:41.380
He's right.

00:08:42.200 --> 00:08:42.660
I know.

00:08:43.100 --> 00:08:45.020
It's too dangerous for them to go.

00:08:45.140 --> 00:08:46.660
We don't know what we'll find.

00:08:47.140 --> 00:08:48.780
So then, do we leave them here?

00:08:49.300 --> 00:08:51.440
They won't be safe, Sai.

00:08:52.090 --> 00:08:52.450
Hmm.

00:08:52.850 --> 00:08:53.650
Hey, Ryo!

00:08:54.940 --> 00:08:56.070
What are you doing?

00:08:57.050 --> 00:09:00.000
Coming down!

00:09:01.080 --> 00:09:02.380
Now what?

00:09:02.380 --> 00:09:04.230
Well?

00:09:04.230 --> 00:09:05.230
Come on!

00:09:05.230 --> 00:09:06.230
Hey!

00:09:06.230 --> 00:09:13.190
Geeks are huge!

00:09:13.190 --> 00:09:14.420
Totally!

00:09:14.420 --> 00:09:26.400
Well, now, I think it's time to see who's home.

00:09:34.750 --> 00:09:37.310
Castle.

00:09:38.250 --> 00:09:39.880
This is Tassel?

00:09:40.080 --> 00:09:48.410
What's wrong?

00:09:49.040 --> 00:09:51.220
Yuli, you and Mia have to stay.

00:09:51.300 --> 00:09:51.620
What?

00:09:52.210 --> 00:09:54.730
Please, Ryo, please.

00:09:55.240 --> 00:09:57.200
You can't make me stay here.

00:09:57.500 --> 00:09:58.820
I won't do it.

00:09:59.030 --> 00:10:00.000
It's Ryo.

00:10:00.800 --> 00:10:01.520
Let me go!

00:10:01.990 --> 00:10:03.410
Take me with you!

00:10:03.840 --> 00:10:13.170
Sorry, Yuli, but you have to listen to me.

00:10:13.460 --> 00:10:14.760
This is not a game.

00:10:15.080 --> 00:10:19.440
Look, we don't know what we're going to find in there, and I don't want to see you get hurt.

00:10:19.900 --> 00:10:22.950
I have to know you and Nia are safe or I can't fight.

00:10:23.010 --> 00:10:24.290
Hey, that's not fair!

00:10:25.170 --> 00:10:27.040
Just a kid and can't wait!

00:10:48.080 --> 00:10:50.160
It was tough, but you had to do it, buddy.

00:10:51.310 --> 00:10:53.770
Oh, yeah, I'm sure Yuli will get over it.

00:10:56.220 --> 00:10:58.390
All right, white place, get going.

00:10:58.620 --> 00:11:00.000
And whatever you do, don't.

00:11:00.000 --> 00:11:02.980
Don't let Yuli and Mia leave your side, okay?

00:11:03.820 --> 00:11:12.050
Kento, I want you to shut the gate behind us.

00:11:12.050 --> 00:11:13.050
Shut it?

00:11:13.050 --> 00:11:15.870
We can't turn back now. Let's go get Tulpa.

00:11:15.870 --> 00:11:22.350
Hmph, no sweat!

00:11:22.350 --> 00:11:25.350
Okay, it's gonna get tense, so everybody keep their guard up.

00:11:25.350 --> 00:11:26.310
Let's do it!

00:11:26.310 --> 00:11:28.930
Let's get it on!

00:11:28.930 --> 00:11:30.000
Rock and roll!

00:11:30.960 --> 00:11:41.400
is dead meat he's all mine the ronin warriors will return now

00:12:00.700 --> 00:12:03.300
You came all this way just to die.

00:12:03.300 --> 00:12:04.790
No way!

00:12:08.120 --> 00:12:10.780
It's an illusion.

00:12:10.780 --> 00:12:12.980
Show yourself, Deus!

00:12:12.980 --> 00:12:19.910
As you wish, and please enjoy my hospitality.

00:12:19.910 --> 00:12:23.110
Open the gates!

00:13:20.760 --> 00:13:23.740
You must have control of them!

00:13:23.740 --> 00:13:27.650
Hey, Deus! You coward! Come out and face me!

00:13:33.200 --> 00:13:34.700
no max for the five of us.

00:13:37.140 --> 00:13:38.420
That's your opinion.

00:13:40.820 --> 00:13:50.980
This armor has more power.

00:13:51.220 --> 00:13:52.060
Come on, guys.

00:13:52.360 --> 00:13:53.660
Yes, please.

00:13:53.860 --> 00:13:56.920
Show me this powerful armor of yours.

00:13:57.060 --> 00:13:58.240
Run while you still can.

00:13:58.780 --> 00:14:00.000
Or face your...

00:14:10.200 --> 00:14:22.330
work what's the matter warriors where's that awesome power you promised why

00:14:22.330 --> 00:14:24.770
doesn't it work

00:14:30.860 --> 00:14:33.860
The spirits must be blocking our power somehow.

00:14:40.850 --> 00:14:47.860
Observation.

00:14:47.860 --> 00:14:50.840
Too bad it's too late to save your lives.

00:14:50.840 --> 00:14:53.430
Web of Deception!

00:16:00.320 --> 00:16:08.450
you're finished we could use our armor

00:16:08.450 --> 00:16:26.980
Yuli didn't mean to hurt you I know he

00:16:26.980 --> 00:16:30.000
didn't mean it the ronin warriors have a lot

00:16:30.000 --> 00:16:34.620
to deal with and they all depend on Ryo. I wish there was just some way I could

00:16:34.620 --> 00:16:40.870
help them. Can you think of a way? We can't just sit here and wait for something to

00:16:40.870 --> 00:16:45.880
happen. They need us. You're right.

00:17:05.720 --> 00:17:15.760
You struggle the more my web bites into your flesh!

00:17:15.760 --> 00:17:19.760
There's fight in you yet, Ryo of the Wildfire!

00:17:19.760 --> 00:17:25.000
It's a shame I must kill you, but perhaps I could spare your life.

00:17:25.000 --> 00:17:30.000
In exchange, you must pledge your loyalty to the Emperor and become...

00:17:30.510 --> 00:17:31.720
I'm a follower.

00:17:31.720 --> 00:17:36.830
I'm free.

00:17:36.830 --> 00:17:38.490
Me?

00:17:38.490 --> 00:17:39.490
I'll get your master!

00:17:39.490 --> 00:17:40.490
Ha!

00:17:40.490 --> 00:17:43.680
I will give him your regrets.

00:17:43.680 --> 00:17:50.520
Not much of a challenge.

00:17:50.520 --> 00:17:53.530
It's almost a shame you could not use your armor.

00:17:53.530 --> 00:17:55.710
You haven't won.

00:17:55.710 --> 00:18:00.000
I will never bow down to you and your master.

00:18:00.410 --> 00:18:06.280
Such foolish pride. It will do nothing to save you now!

00:18:31.470 --> 00:18:55.220
where'd they go what he wants me to do with this

00:19:11.840 --> 00:19:26.150
What's this? A woman and a boy? Why are you here?

00:20:48.270 --> 00:20:49.010
Nightmare.

00:21:31.690 --> 00:21:39.550
the wildfire. Your armor is powerful, but will not be enough to save you from my wrath.

00:21:39.550 --> 00:21:44.550
I will never let you and your friends escape.

00:21:44.550 --> 00:21:54.370
Yuli, I'm sorry. I'm sorry for what I did earlier.

00:21:54.370 --> 00:21:59.640
I know. I could tell you didn't mean it. You were just really tense.

00:22:00.120 --> 00:22:02.790
Good thing you two came to help us out.

00:22:02.790 --> 00:22:04.390
You really saved the day.

00:22:04.390 --> 00:22:07.330
Well, it wasn't us, really.

00:22:07.330 --> 00:22:09.160
It was this staff.

00:22:09.160 --> 00:22:12.930
Well, then that must mean that someone is on our side.

00:22:12.930 --> 00:22:14.670
Yeah, that's right.

00:22:14.670 --> 00:22:16.870
And it's time to find out who.

00:22:16.870 --> 00:22:21.510
At last, the Ronin Warriors are inside the Dynasty gates.

00:22:21.510 --> 00:22:24.410
What dangers lie ahead?

00:22:24.410 --> 00:22:26.050
What traps await them?

00:22:26.050 --> 00:22:28.530
They stand before Talpa's castle.

00:22:28.530 --> 00:22:30.000
They vow once again to

00:22:30.000 --> 00:22:39.380
fight this battle to the end
